{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rPcGLemd2f1793055304.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>沙特阿拉伯國營能源公司沙特阿美據報快將達成總值100億美元的融資協議，當中有不少中資銀行參與。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，沙特阿美將於未來數星期達成循環貸款協議，獲包括中國銀行、中國工商銀行、滙豐銀行、摩根大通及三菱UFJ銀行參與。報道指，沙特阿美受惠於伊朗戰事推高油價，但近期受到伊朗支持的胡塞武裝組織襲擊，打擊原油產能，今次融資可增強公司的財政實力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:40:55.418470+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T22:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T01:18:10.248581+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T23:38:36.644999+00:00","content_hash":"d316dae8da2bdb039feac915672826c0a3169650fa725c10993079c041dc12f7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:40:55.418470+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}